240
00:29:04,826 --> 00:29:05,660
Jangan pergi.

241
00:29:08,580 --> 00:29:09,414
Kenapa?

242
00:29:11,541 --> 00:29:13,877
Kau tak mengerti arah pembicaraannya?

243
00:29:13,960 --> 00:29:15,295
Kalian umpan.

244
00:29:16,421 --> 00:29:17,922
Selalu begitu, 'kan?

245
00:29:19,549 --> 00:29:21,342
- Aku harus pergi.
- Kang Sang-ung.

246
00:29:24,596 --> 00:29:25,597
Kenapa?

247
00:29:32,312 --> 00:29:33,521
SURAT TAGIHAN UTANG…

248
00:29:35,690 --> 00:29:38,359
- Kenapa ada padamu?
- Aku kerja di sini.

249
00:29:39,444 --> 00:29:41,863
- Kenapa kau kerja di situ?
- Menurutmu?

250
00:29:47,869 --> 00:29:49,537
Kau berutang tanpa setahuku,

251
00:29:50,914 --> 00:29:52,207
pertemuan keluarga kacau,

252
00:29:52,707 --> 00:29:55,585
aku menjadi jaminanmu,
dan kita tak punya uang.

253
00:29:55,668 --> 00:29:57,003
Itu semua tak masalah.

254
00:29:57,086 --> 00:29:59,005
Uang bisa dicari untuk melunasi.

255
00:29:59,506 --> 00:30:02,383
Lebih baik pakai uang pribadi
untuk menjadi kuat.

256
00:30:03,301 --> 00:30:04,135
Sang-ung, ini…

257
00:30:06,262 --> 00:30:07,388
berbeda.

258
00:30:13,394 --> 00:30:17,482
Hidup kita dipertaruhkan
untuk melawan penjahat.

259
00:30:18,900 --> 00:30:19,943
Aku tak yakin.

260
00:30:34,082 --> 00:30:35,083
Min-suk.

261
00:30:36,501 --> 00:30:38,169
Aku juga ingin hidup normal.

262
00:30:40,088 --> 00:30:42,215
Dengan tenang dan bahagia bersamamu.

263
00:30:44,175 --> 00:30:46,886
Bangun pagi bersama lalu berangkat kerja.

264
00:30:48,012 --> 00:30:51,766
Sepulang kerja, kita makan malam bersama.

265
00:30:54,394 --> 00:30:56,187
Aku pun ingin seperti itu.

266
00:30:58,064 --> 00:30:58,898
Tetapi, apa?

267
00:30:59,899 --> 00:31:01,150
Karena itu aku pergi.

268
00:31:05,488 --> 00:31:06,322
Lalu…

269
00:31:11,369 --> 00:31:12,871
selain kita…

270
00:31:16,666 --> 00:31:19,794
aku harap orang-orang di sana

271
00:31:20,378 --> 00:31:21,337
juga selamat

272
00:31:22,171 --> 00:31:24,424
dan hidup normal dengan bahagia.

273
00:31:32,682 --> 00:31:33,683
Ini tugasku.

274
00:31:35,560 --> 00:31:36,978
Hanya aku yang bisa.

275
00:31:54,203 --> 00:31:55,330
Kau perlu berapa?

276
00:32:00,543 --> 00:32:03,838
Untuk menghancurkan brankas
atau apa pun itu.

277
00:32:04,964 --> 00:32:06,174
Perlu uang berapa?

278
00:32:10,637 --> 00:32:12,430
KREDIT JEONGJA

279
00:32:21,230 --> 00:32:22,065
Kenapa?

280
00:32:28,738 --> 00:32:30,281
PROPOSAL PENGELUARAN

281
00:32:31,658 --> 00:32:32,784
PEMOHON: KIM MIN-SUK

282
00:32:32,867 --> 00:32:35,036
BIAYA OPERASIONAL: 30.000.000

283
00:32:37,997 --> 00:32:40,041
Kenapa aku harus memberimu uang?

284
00:32:40,124 --> 00:32:43,753
Sang-ung harus ke Gimhae besok,
tapi tak punya uang.

285
00:32:46,005 --> 00:32:47,632
Apa urusannya denganku?

286
00:32:47,715 --> 00:32:51,803
Aku kenal alamat
yang akan dituju Sang-ung.

287
00:32:52,303 --> 00:32:54,472
Meski terlihat seperti bank biasa,

288
00:32:54,555 --> 00:32:58,601
isinya semua kepentingan Mundane Vanguard.
Keamanannya sangat ketat.

289
00:32:59,936 --> 00:33:01,562
Alamat awal Kredit Jeongja.

290
00:33:02,063 --> 00:33:04,357
PINDAH DARI 148-31 BUGOK-DONG, GIMHAE-SI

291
00:33:06,442 --> 00:33:08,945
KREDIT JEONGJA

292
00:33:18,413 --> 00:33:21,457
Memang rencanamu
mengirim Sang-ung ke sana, 'kan?

293
00:33:21,541 --> 00:33:23,251
Jadi, kau mendekati Sang-ung.

294
00:33:27,380 --> 00:33:28,548
Dia…

295
00:33:31,092 --> 00:33:34,137
pergi karena dia baik,
tapi aku tak bisa diam saja.

296
00:33:34,846 --> 00:33:36,597
Aku tak ingin tahu alasanmu.

297
00:33:36,681 --> 00:33:38,933
Bekali dia uang jika kau menyuruhnya.

298
00:33:40,393 --> 00:33:41,394
Jika tidak…

299
00:33:45,815 --> 00:33:46,941
dia dilarang pergi.

300
00:33:58,494 --> 00:34:01,581
Kang Sang-ung menikahi istri yang baik.

301
00:34:14,635 --> 00:34:16,387
DIREKTUR JBC LEE JEONG-SU PRO-BEOMHA

302
00:34:20,349 --> 00:34:23,019
Bukankah kita
harus turun menghentikan mereka?

303
00:34:24,020 --> 00:34:26,147
Sebelum lebih banyak orang terancam.

304
00:34:30,568 --> 00:34:31,569
Bocah ini

305
00:34:32,445 --> 00:34:34,781
tak tahu hal yang dikerjakannya.

306
00:34:40,078 --> 00:34:41,871
- Ya.
- Laporan insiden kelab.

307
00:34:41,954 --> 00:34:45,958
Kita harus lakukan penyidikan lanjut
dan memanggil Kang Sang-ung lagi, bukan?

308
00:34:48,211 --> 00:34:49,045
Tentu saja.

309
00:34:49,712 --> 00:34:53,091
Apa hubungan Kang Sang-ung dan Beomha?

310
00:34:53,800 --> 00:34:57,720
Peternakan dan kelab
tempat Kang Sang-ung berada milik Beomha.

311
00:35:00,223 --> 00:35:01,182
KEBAKARAN…

312
00:35:01,265 --> 00:35:03,935
TANGGAL: 23 APRIL,
PETERNAKAN BEOMHA, HWASEONG

313
00:35:04,894 --> 00:35:06,646
KASUS NARKOBA KELAB MECENAT

314
00:35:07,647 --> 00:35:08,648
KEBAKARAN DAN…

315
00:35:09,232 --> 00:35:10,650
KEBAKARAN PETERNAKAN BEOMHA

316
00:35:11,150 --> 00:35:12,902
KASUS NARKOBA KELAB MECENAT

317
00:35:23,996 --> 00:35:24,831
Kalian

318
00:35:25,790 --> 00:35:27,166
tahu "daging belakang"?

319
00:35:27,834 --> 00:35:28,668
- Apa?
- Apa?

320
00:35:29,710 --> 00:35:30,837
Saat memotong babi,

321
00:35:31,337 --> 00:35:34,382
ada daging lemusir,
iga, sirloin, dan tenderloin.

322
00:35:34,465 --> 00:35:37,760
Namun, ada potongan sisa
yang tak termasuk di situ.

323
00:35:38,594 --> 00:35:39,554
Itu daging belakang.

324
00:35:40,721 --> 00:35:41,764
Lalu kenapa?

325
00:35:44,392 --> 00:35:46,561
Ayo makan daging belakang besok.

326
00:35:47,061 --> 00:35:48,062
Di mana?

327
00:35:50,231 --> 00:35:51,107
Gimhae.

328
00:35:58,656 --> 00:35:59,740
Apa ini?

329
00:36:02,994 --> 00:36:03,953
Itu 30 juta won.

330
00:36:04,704 --> 00:36:05,788
Uang dari mana?

331
00:36:06,831 --> 00:36:07,665
Entah.

332
00:36:11,836 --> 00:36:14,046
Aku harap semuanya segera berakhir.

333
00:36:16,090 --> 00:36:18,176
Saat kau pulang nanti,

334
00:36:19,385 --> 00:36:21,053
aku akan ceritakan hal lucu.

335
00:36:22,263 --> 00:36:25,266
Apa-apaan? Tak bisa sekarang saja?

336
00:36:25,349 --> 00:36:28,686
Tak mau. Aku ceritakan saat kau pulang.

337
00:36:34,233 --> 00:36:35,067
Oke.

338
00:36:35,860 --> 00:36:36,694
Aku pergi.

339
00:36:37,612 --> 00:36:39,864
- Dadah.
- Terima kasih.

340
00:37:03,804 --> 00:37:05,389
Benar ini tempatnya?

341
00:37:05,473 --> 00:37:08,100
BANK TABUNGAN GIMHAE

342
00:37:08,184 --> 00:37:09,227
Jantung?

343
00:37:10,228 --> 00:37:11,187
Terlihat usang.

344
00:37:13,231 --> 00:37:14,899
Tampaknya bank daerah biasa,

345
00:37:16,609 --> 00:37:19,028
tapi isinya fasilitas
keamanan tertinggi negara.

346
00:37:37,088 --> 00:37:39,799
Tangkap begitu mereka keluar bawa ampul.

347
00:37:40,841 --> 00:37:44,428
Mereka harus dibungkus rapi
sebelum diberikan ke Ayah.

348
00:37:46,097 --> 00:37:48,015
Namun, jika situasinya memburuk,

349
00:37:48,808 --> 00:37:51,894
tangkap Kang Sang-ung
sebelum kedahuluan Jo Nathan.

350
00:38:10,788 --> 00:38:14,625
Bagaimanapun, aku pemenang permainannya.

351
00:38:26,345 --> 00:38:27,346
Bisa kubantu?

352
00:38:31,976 --> 00:38:33,644
Silakan ke sini.

353
00:39:10,848 --> 00:39:12,558
Secara garis besar,

354
00:39:12,641 --> 00:39:14,643
kami memang umpan.

355
00:39:45,174 --> 00:39:46,008
Kita mulai.

356
00:39:49,887 --> 00:39:53,849
Pelanggan nomor 15 ke loket dua.

357
00:39:56,435 --> 00:39:58,187
Karena sudah telanjur,

358
00:39:58,687 --> 00:40:00,940
aku akan jadi umpan yang baik.

359
00:40:05,945 --> 00:40:08,155
Halo, Tuan. Ada yang bisa kubantu?

360
00:40:08,906 --> 00:40:12,326
- Aku ingin tahu tentang pinjaman.
- Boleh lihat KTP-mu?

361
00:40:15,663 --> 00:40:17,832
Namaku Kang Sang-ung.

362
00:40:36,976 --> 00:40:39,145
Keluarlah!

363
00:40:39,854 --> 00:40:41,856
Tuan, tolong keluar!

364
00:40:47,236 --> 00:40:48,863
Berengsek!

365
00:40:53,617 --> 00:40:55,828
BANK TABUNGAN GIMHAE

366
00:41:16,182 --> 00:41:17,725
Pak Gi, lewat pintu belakang.

367
00:42:00,559 --> 00:42:01,560
Sudah lengkap?

368
00:44:59,446 --> 00:45:02,741
Terjemahan subtitle oleh Siti Muthia Hasna
